{
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "autoloader-generic",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [],
      "lines": [
        "The app ships no composer/autoload.php, so the server registers its generic loader for lib/ and looks every class up in the file system.",
        "  A composer/composer.json with config.vendor-dir \".\", config.optimize-autoloader true, a config.autoloader-suffix and autoload.psr-4 {\"OCA\\\\ChatArchive\\\\\": \"../lib/\"} makes composer dump-autoload write composer/autoload.php with a class map; the code of the app does not change."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "private-api",
      "level": "warn",
      "places": [
        "lib/FullTextSearch/ChatProvider.php:60 OC\\FullTextSearch\\Model\\SearchTemplate",
        "lib/FullTextSearch/ChatProvider.php:129 OC\\FullTextSearch\\Model\\IndexDocument",
        "lib/FullTextSearch/ChatProvider.php:172 OC\\FullTextSearch\\Model\\DocumentAccess"
      ],
      "lines": [
        "3 uses of the private API of the server in 1 file. Only OCP and NCU are public: what is below OC changes without notice between majors.",
